@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-access-token
@conversation = 18fdcc69-269d-4c1a-9123-56f83cd36d50
@message = 28fdcc69-269d-4c1a-9123-56f83cd36d50
@peer = 38fdcc69-269d-4c1a-9123-56f83cd36d50
@role = 40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@report = 48fdcc69-269d-4c1a-9123-56f83cd36d50

### Mailbox; folder is inbox, read, sent, deleted or left
GET {{baseUrl}}/private-messages?folder=inbox&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Conversation details
GET {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/{{conversation}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recipient lookup
GET {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/recipients?search=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Compose; all chats are groups and role recipients require PrivateMessageModeration.Manage
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject":"Discussion","content":"[b]Hello[/b]","userIds":["{{peer}}"],"roleIds":[],"bccUserIds":[],"bccRoleIds":[],"isSystem":false}

### System message; dedicated moderation grant required
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject":"System notice","content":"Please reply privately.","userIds":[],"roleIds":["{{role}}"],"bccUserIds":[],"bccRoleIds":[],"isSystem":true}

### Reply; replyToId must be a visible message in this conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/{{conversation}}/reply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"[quote]Hello[/quote]Reply","replyToId":"{{message}}"}

### Invite additional peers to an ordinary group
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/{{conversation}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userIds":["{{peer}}"],"roleIds":[],"bccUserIds":[],"bccRoleIds":[]}

### Read
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/{{conversation}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete only from your mailbox
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/{{conversation}}/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/{{conversation}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leave an ordinary group
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/{{conversation}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rejoin an invited group
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/{{conversation}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your block list
GET {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/blocks?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Block ordinary direct messaging in both directions
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/blocks/{{peer}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unblock
POST {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/blocks/{{peer}}/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report accessible evidence; sourceType may also be profile, forumPost, chatMessage or newsComment
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userIds":[],"reason":"Misconduct","sourceType":"privateMessage","sourceId":"{{message}}"}

### Report multiple users without a content source
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userIds":["{{peer}}"],"reason":"Misconduct","sourceType":null,"sourceId":null}

### Report management
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?status=open&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report details and evidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{report}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dedicated report conversation access
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{report}}/conversation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resolve; action is dismiss, resolve or ban, null banUntil means permanent
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{report}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"resolve","banUntil":null,"reporterMessage":"Thank you for your report.","reportedEmail":"Please follow the community rules."}

### Retry only pending or failed notifications
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{report}}/retry-email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft delete a report
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{report}}/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Developer deleted report listing
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?deleted=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Developer restore
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{report}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Developer permanent deletion
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{report}}/hard/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inaccessible content is not disclosed
GET {{baseUrl}}/private-messages/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
